				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "It gives the project one clear command surface. It avoids leaking lower-level GsDevKit concepts like registries into everyday Catalyst workflows. It keeps onboarding short without blocking advanced use later."
			},
